  "updatedAt": "2026-10-21",
  "manifestChangelog": "2026-10-21 release: brain-viewer 0.88.0 (0.88.0, on top of 0.87.1 released earlier today. In a team member's copy, Today is back in the menu and opens on From Zak: the questions and new files from the owner's side, drawn so the member can ac). 2026-10-21 release: brain-viewer 0.87.1 (From 0.68.0 to 0.87.1. Today opens on the day: Up first (the one to three things picked for you), In progress (the projects you are working in), what is new since you last looked, and one list you can). 2026-10-07 release: brain-viewer 0.68.0 (Viewer 0.68.0: Today is the landing page and the one queue; the menu folds; stable question ids so answers flow back into preps; the day drawing derived; the chat picker; the exclusive port bind and a). 2026-10-02 release: brain-viewer 0.59.0 (The home board's horizon milestones and the flow ring now read from files in your brain (context/horizon.json and context/flow.json) instead of being written into the widgets; with no file they say so). 2026-10-02 release: brain-viewer 0.56.1 (Everything since 0.48.0. Numbered lists count again and a question opens the file it points at (0.48.1). The chat stands alone, pictures drop onto the notepad, and a call's prep shows before its card). 2026-10-02 release: brain-survey 1.0.0, mentee-project 0.1.0 and brain-status 0.1.0 join the pack as folder components. 2026-10-02 release: ferryman 1.3.1 (User-Agent on every call, the Cloudflare 1010 fix; BRAIN_ROOT override). 2026-09-23 release: brain-viewer 0.48.0 (The viewer is now a pf-pack component, replaced whole on update, and what you make lives outside it. Your settings, board layouts, looks and widgets live in viewer/ at the brain root, which no update). 2026-09-23 release: brain-viewer 0.48.0 (The viewer is now a pf-pack component, replaced whole on update, and what you make lives outside it. Your settings, board layouts, looks and widgets live in viewer/ at the brain root, which no update). 2026-09-23 release: update 1.1.0 (folder components: install-component.py replaces a component folder whole; the Brain Viewer ships as one). 2026-09-03 release: ferryman 1.3.0 (push.py was sending a `source` key the import schema rejects 422, so every 1.2.0 push failed at validate -- removed; --participants ships as a frontmatter YAML list; --base flag; runbook example corrected; participants matrix row LIVE). 2026-08-28 release: ferryman 1.2.0 (PATCH correction path, API catalog, owner rules, Topics trap, participants gap documented), transcript-processor 1.2.1 (owner rules + corrected push facts + verbatim check), people-adapter 1.0.1 (career-arc facet), shell v0.2 (standing reminders folded into current-focus, dispatcher-cursor dropped, Ferret reference removed). v2 (2026-07-28): per-skill files[] mappings (src in this repo -> dest in a brain) so the assembler can build a new brain straight from the registry; shell component versioned; update-skill + ferryman-adapter-contract now bundled. All v1 fields unchanged — /update keeps working.",
